          "id": "${item.id}",
          "name": "Numen",
          "passive_description": "<p>This creature does not regain <strong>MP</strong> except from <strong>Rest</strong>.</p><hr><p><em>The values on this sheet are the unscaled baseline.</em> When summoned by <strong>Create Phantasm: Numen</strong> they are rewritten from the summoner:</p><ul><li><strong>Phantasmal Vitality</strong> = twice the summoner's base Insight die size, plus their level.</li><li><strong>Max MP</strong> = 30, raised to 40 at summoner Lv. 20 and 50 at Lv. 40.</li><li><strong>On-hit damage</strong> = HR + 14, raised to 18 / 20 at those same levels by the <em>Numen Ascendance</em> effect.</li><li><strong>Damage type</strong> is set by the essence chosen at summoning (Ravana / Asura / Diablos).</li></ul>",
          "roll": "",
          "uuid": "Actor.ZPPCxB0eOJPulEHv.Item.Y7ds6luUU5CLFH3T"
